#: scanparams.cpp:524
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<qt><b>Problem: No scanner found, or unable to access it</b><p>There was a "
"problem using the SANE (Scanner Access Now Easy) library to access the "
"scanner device.  There may be a problem with your SANE installation, or it "
"may not be configured to support your scanner.<p>Check that SANE is "
"correctly installed and configured on your system, and also that the scanner "
"device name and settings are correct.<p>See the SANE project home page (<a "
"href=\"http://www.sane-project.org\">www.sane-project.org</a>) for more "
"information on SANE installation and setup."
msgstr ""
"<qt><b>Produciuse un problema: non se atopou ningún escáner, ou non é "
"posíbel acceder ao escáner indicado.</b> <p>Produciuse un problema durante o "
"uso da biblioteca SANE (Scanner Access Now Easy) para acceder ao escáner. "
"Pode que exista un problema de instalación de SANE, ou pode que a biblioteca "
"non estea configura para funcionar co seu escáner. <p>Asegúrese de que SANE "
"estea instalado e configurado correctamente, e que o nome e a configuración "
"do escáner son correctas. <p>Consulte o sitio web do proxecto SANE (<a href="
"\"http://www.sane-project.org\">www.sane-project.org</a>) para obter máis "
"información sobre a instalación e configuración de SANE."

